{"Do": "run", "Code": "(* %% Loop *)\ndefn run(f, n)\n  y = [1.0, 0.0]\n  for i in 1..n\n    y = y + 0.001 * f(i * 0.001, y)\n  end\n  y[1]\nend", "Line": 6, "Path": "twins.ce"}
